<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Planning Sciences cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Planning Sciences cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Planning Sciences International Plc to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday Planning Sciences said it expects to make a &quot;small&quot; profit for the first quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1-3/4 to 5-1/4.</p>
</text>
